THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This product bundles or depends on third-party components distributed under
their own licenses. The list below is what is adopted today, from package.json
and src-tauri/Cargo.toml; each was chosen for its licence and maintenance and is
checked by the dependency audit in CI (npm audit, cargo audit). The
authoritative list is the one generated from the dependency manifests and their
lockfiles, and a dependency added without a line here is an incomplete one.

That generated list is src/features/about/notices.json, written by
scripts/notices.mjs from Cargo.lock and package-lock.json: every crate compiled
into the Windows binary and every npm package of the production tree, each with
the licence its package declares. The About screen shows it beside this file,
and a gate fails when it no longer matches the lockfiles.

The interface (package.json):

  Tauri .......................... Apache-2.0 OR MIT
  Tauri dialog and log plugins ... MIT OR Apache-2.0
  React, React DOM ............... MIT
  Vite ........................... MIT
  TypeScript ..................... Apache-2.0
  Tailwind CSS ................... MIT
  TanStack Query ................. MIT
  Fluent UI System Icons ......... MIT

The host (src-tauri/Cargo.toml):

  tauri, tauri-build ............. Apache-2.0 OR MIT
  tauri-plugin-dialog ............ Apache-2.0 OR MIT
  tauri-plugin-log ............... Apache-2.0 OR MIT
  serde, serde_json .............. MIT OR Apache-2.0
  thiserror ...................... MIT OR Apache-2.0
  rusqlite / SQLite .............. MIT / Public Domain
  log ............................ MIT OR Apache-2.0
  uuid ........................... Apache-2.0 OR MIT
  chrono ......................... MIT OR Apache-2.0
