  image .......................... MIT OR Apache-2.0
    the decoders its features compile into the binary, one per format a photo
    may arrive as (BMP needs no crate of its own):
    zune-jpeg, zune-core ......... MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR Zlib   (JPEG)
    png, fdeflate, flate2 ........ MIT OR Apache-2.0           (PNG)
