FONT METRICS

The PDF reports are set in the standard PDF fonts Helvetica and Helvetica-Bold,
which every PDF reader supplies. No font file is embedded in a report, shipped
in the product or kept in this repository.

To wrap text, the host carries the advance width of each character of the two
faces (src-tauri/src/report/winansi.rs). Those numbers are the WX values of
Adobe's Core 14 font metrics files Helvetica.afm and Helvetica-Bold.afm,
version 002.000, placed at the WinAnsiEncoding codes of PDF 32000-1:2008,
Annex D.2. The files carry this notice, retained here as their terms require:

  Copyright (c) 1985, 1987, 1989, 1990, 1997 Adobe Systems Incorporated.
  All Rights Reserved.
  Helvetica is a trademark of Linotype-Hell AG and/or its subsidiaries.

Adobe's terms for those metrics allow them to be used, copied and distributed
for any purpose and without charge, with or without modification, provided the
copyright notices are retained and modifications are noted. The widths are used
unmodified; only their order was changed, from the files' glyph names to the
encoding's codes.
